  "description": "Quickly pick up leaves, branches, grass, and other debris, it is a good helper to help you clean up the yard.\nFitment\nThe lawn sweeper easily connects to most lawn tractors, zero-turn mowers (ZTRs), and ATVs. Quickly adjust brush height via lever for optimal pickup on driveways, sidewalks, lawns, and gardens.\nFeatures\n50-Inch Extra-Wide Sweeping Path:‌ Features a wide 50-inch clearing width to quickly and efficiently collect leaves, grass clippings, and other dry debris over large areas.\n25 Cu Ft High-Capacity Hopper w/ Easy-Dump Rope:‌ Massive hopper (approx. 25 cubic feet) minimizes dumping stops. Empty loads easily without leaving your seat using the integrated dump rope\n‌Universal Hitch & Brush Height Adjustment:‌ Easily connects to most lawn tractors, zero-turn mowers (ZTRs), and ATVs. Quickly adjust brush height via lever for optimal pickup on driveways, sidewalks, lawns, and gardens.\nDurable Folding Construction:‌ Heavy-duty steel frame and wear-resistant nylon brushes tackle wet or rough terrain. Folds compactly for wall hanging or shed storage to maximize space.\nPowerful Brush System & Smooth Operation:‌ Four 10-inch diameter nylon brushes spin powerfully to lift leaves, pine needles, twigs, and grass. Durable, puncture-resistant wheels ensure smooth rolling and are gentle on turf.",
